      "summary_en": "Aurora's spells and attacks exorcise spirits from the enemies she damages. Exorcised spirits follow Aurora around and heal her.",
      "summary_zh": "阿萝拉的技能或攻击伤害能从敌人身上抽离出灵物。被抽离灵物跟随阿萝拉并治疗她。",
