      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Aurora sends out a missile that curses any enemies it hits. She can then recast the ability to draw active curses back toward herself, damaging foes who are hit along the way.",
      "summary_zh": "阿萝拉放出一道飞弹，诅咒所有命中的敌人。阿萝拉可以再次施放该技能，来将所有激活的诅咒抽回自己身上。诅咒在返回途中会对命中的敌人造成伤害。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1648721:4021922"
      ]
    },
